boretum trails","subject_type":"sequence_stop","supported_claim":"The campus Arboretum is free, open to all during daylight hours, and contains more than 2.5 miles of trails through three ecosystems.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/administrative-offices/arboretum","source_title":"Arboretum | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3178,"longitude":-93.974,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Plan this stop before dusk and observe trail and weather conditions.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-049","buckets":["college-first-weekend"],"subject_name":"Locate the library and Student Union connection","subject_type":"sequence_stop","supported_claim":"The College locates Folke Bernadotte Memorial Library in the heart of campus connected to the Student Union.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/administrative-offices/library","source_title":"Library | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3243,"longitude":-93.9717,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Weekend library access is limited: the published semester schedule lists Sunday noon–10 p.m. and no Saturday hours.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-050","buckets":["college-first-weekend"],"subject_name":"Visit Christ Chapel","subject_type":"sequence_stop","supported_claim":"Christ Chapel serves as a campus venue for worship, performances, community gatherings, and quiet reflection.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/facilities/christ-chapel","source_title":"Christ Chapel | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3227,"longitude":-93.9717,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Be mindful of scheduled services, rehearsals, performances, and quiet use.","cost_status